&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;NISSHINBO COMPREHENSIVE PRECISION MACHINING (GURGAON) PRIVATE LTD.（インド）を設立（現・連結子会社）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:11.3pt;min-height:11.3pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:11pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;2023年11月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;TMD FRICTION GROUP S.A.（ルクセンブルク）の全株式を譲渡&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
