  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00544-000:NotesRegardingTransferFromNonCurrentAssetsToRealEstateForSaleDueToChangeInPurposeOfHoldingTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-31.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※10　下記の有形固定資産及び無形固定資産を、保有目的の変更により棚卸資産に振替えています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
